      "description": "Phase 1 Intro Cutscene Sequencer. If active combat flag $FF0E1D:0 is set, jumps directly to active tick 0x0163A4. Otherwise increments cutscene timer +$B0(a6): timer < 90 calls 0x015AFC; timer 90..122 fades CRAM line 3 $FF136C ($5D0E6->$5D106) via 0x00302E, triggers SFX $700219 at step 0 and $FF20AE=$12 via 0x00DAE6 at step 32; timer 123..149 calls 0x015AFC; timer 150..182 fades CRAM line 4 $FF13AC, sets $0200 across 5 linked segments and SFX $700219 at step 32; timer 183..210 calls 0x015AFC; timer >= 211 calls Sub-Mode 3 init 0x015C4A, copies 32B CRAM from $5D126 to $FF13AC, asserts $FF164D:0, calls $DAC2($102), and activates combat $FF0E1D:0."
