      "description": "Phase 1 Active Combat Master Tick. Clears +$72, +$76, +$83, +$9C. Decrements invulnerability timer +$AE, asserting invuln +$82=$FF while > 0. Decrements hit-flash timer +$AF, restoring normal palette $0200 across 5 linked segments upon reaching 0 (if HP != 0). On incoming damage +$86 != 0: sets flash palette $4200 across 5 segments, sets +$AF=2; if heavy damage (bit 14 or 15 set), sets +$AE=2 and +$82=$FF; subtracts defense +$92 from 12-bit damage (clamped >= 1) and applies to HP +$8A; on HP = 0, initiates death: sets State $16, anim 8, vz = +$20000, +$38 |= $C, $FF210A=$0FFF, calls 0x00E96C (d0=10) across 4 child slots (stride $BC). Dispatches +$04 via jump table 0x0164C8."
